{"id": "34459", "title": "大少奶奶当不当？", "author": "橙星", "category": "文学名著", "count": 52, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34459.htm", "intro": "小小少女总是怀抱着粉红色的梦，而她小时候的梦想就是长大能当个少奶奶，说她年幼无知也好，说她丑小鸭妄想变飞天鹅也罢，可人人都有幻想的自由、作梦的权利，而他这个小少爷却大剌剌的戳破她的幻想，还当着众人的面嘲笑她！好，这笔帐她记住了，深深深深的记住了，她就偏要朝少奶奶的目标前进，总有一天要他跌破一百副眼镜；果然十年风水轮流转，她前途看涨，越来越有少奶奶的味道，可他却从当年的风光少爷，变成逃家的落魄少爷，呵呵！这下可好，如今逮到机会，她怎能不把握机会报一报当年的仇？……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34459", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2187048.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2187049.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2187050.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2187051.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2187052.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2187053.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2187054.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2187055.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2187056.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2187057.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2187058.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2187059.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2187060.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2187061.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2187062.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2187063.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2187064.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2187065.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2187066.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2187067.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2187068.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2187069.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2187070.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2187071.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file"